NONONONONONONONOONONO!
Even if Brand acted chaotically (though I tend to think of him as "neutral"),
it doesn't necessarily mean his sword was chaotic!
In fact, that would make very little sense considering the Zelazny cosmology:
The Logrus (Chaos) and the Pattern are two extreme poles in eternal (?:-)
conflict with each other. Brand's Werewindle, just like Corwin's Grayswandir,
bore a portion of the Pattern, which was the opposite of Chaos in Zelazny's
world. 
Neutral artifact, *maybe*, but *definitely* NOT chaotic!

